PyMuPDF and use it under its GNU Affero General Public License version 3
(AGPL-3.0) option; we are not replacing PyMuPDF and are not purchasing a
commercial license for this open-source distribution.

The obliq-OCR project source is MIT-licensed. That MIT license does not
