AGPL-3.0 obligations applicable to distributing or operating a combined work.
In particular, AGPL-3.0 section 13 requires offering corresponding source to
users interacting with a modified program over a network. If a future
distribution or deployment cannot comply with AGPL-3.0, obtain an appropriate
Artifex commercial license before use; this project does not authorize
closed-source use of PyMuPDF under the AGPL option.

This records the project's intended compliance path, not legal advice or a
