OCR model weights
-----------------

`rapidocr_onnxruntime` 1.4.4 bundles these default ONNX weights:

| Model file | Purpose | License |
|---|---|---|
| `ch_PP-OCRv4_det_infer.onnx` | Text detection | Apache-2.0 |
| `ch_PP-OCRv4_rec_infer.onnx` | Text recognition | Apache-2.0 |
| `ch_ppocr_mobile_v2.0_cls_infer.onnx` | Text orientation classification | Apache-2.0 |

The PP-OCR model files are from the PaddleOCR model family and distributed in
ONNX format by RapidAI. The RapidOCR package metadata declares Apache-2.0.
The model files are provided by that dependency; obliq-OCR does not copy them
into its own source tree.

Sources:
- RapidOCR project: https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR
- RapidOCR Apache-2.0 license: https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/blob/main/LICENSE
- RapidOCR model list: https://rapidai.github.io/RapidOCRDocs/main/model_list/
- PaddleOCR project: https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR
- PaddleOCR Apache-2.0 license: https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR/blob/main/LICENSE

